== Introduction to Optimization for Engineers -- ELEC 400O | MECH 410Q | MECH 540G
Winter Term, 2026--27. Instructors: [https://www.albertopadoan.com/ Alberto Padoan] and [https://mech.ubc.ca/dominic-liao-mcpherson/ Dominic Liao-McPherson]. \n
